    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a bridge between curiosity and problem-solving for me—like a puzzle I enjoy solving. It’s both my passion and a tool I use daily, whether in teaching or baking recipes that require precise measurements. The abstract beauty of equations fascinates me, but the practical applications keep it engaging.",
